**Date:** 1 November 2026 · **Replaces:** [0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)

## Context

Merging on subject line put 412 reports in #4471. They hold two bugs: the parser reading dates
month first (379 reports) and the booking-v3 form hint (33 reports). The 33 had no ticket
of their own. Intake's browser-locale tag was wrong for 38 of the 412.

## Decision

Two reports are the same issue when they share a **cause**, worked out from the tenant's locale
and booking form (`causeOf` in `src/lib/kb/causes.ts`). Subject line and intake tag do not
decide. A report with no tenant on file stays unmerged until someone places it.

## Consequences

- Slower than reading a subject, but the desk never again counts one bug's reports under another.
- Every ticket carries its own report count, counted by id (an export can repeat a report).
- Filed from this: parser bug (379), booking-v3 hint bug (33).

